  "prediction": "**Implementing Telework to Reduce Office Space: Challenges and Opportunities**\n\nThe Government Accountability Office (GAO) conducted a study to examine how civilian Chief Financial Officer (CFO) Act agencies use telework to reduce office space and increase efficiency. The study found that most agencies have a telework program in place, but many face challenges in using telework as a strategic space-planning tool.\n\n**Key Findings:**\n\n* 23 civilian CFO Act agencies reported using telework to reduce or use space more efficiently, with 15 agencies incorporating telework into their space-planning policies and procedures.\n* Agencies reported using telework to reduce space, lower real estate costs, and increase operational effectiveness.\n* GSA, OJP, and CDC were identified as agencies that have successfully used telework to reduce space and increase efficiency, with GSA achieving a 30% reduction in space through telework and hoteling.\n* Challenges faced by agencies include human capital issues, such as negotiating workspace changes with collective bargaining units and managing organizational change, as well as difficulty measuring cost savings resulting from space reductions attributable to telework.\n\n**Recommendations:**\n\n* The GAO recommends that the Administrator of General Services (GSA) develop guidance on using telework as a strategic space-planning tool and make it readily available to agencies.\n* The GSA should also complete the Workplace Investment and Feasibility Tool, which will help agencies assess the benefits and costs of telework to achieve office space efficiencies.\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThe study highlights the potential of telework to reduce office space and increase efficiency, but also identifies challenges that agencies face in implementing telework as a strategic space-planning tool. The GAO's recommendations aim to provide agencies with the necessary guidance and tools to overcome these challenges and achieve their goals of reducing space and increasing efficiency.",
